4. Strengths (What's Working Well)
MV3 compliance: Extension correctly uses service worker, avoids `eval`, uses `scripting` API properly.
Message passing: The single consolidated `onMessage` listener in `background.js` is clean and well-structured.
Error handling in Drug Delivery flow: Timeout logic, page-not-found, and result detection are thoughtfully implemented.
SPA navigation support: `MutationObserver` + debounced injection correctly handles the Angular SPA on arcusair.
Print system: IV and Aux sticker print windows are self-contained HTML+CSS, properly isolated from the extension page styles.
Code comments: All files have clear section headers and inline comments explaining intent.
`'use strict'`: Applied consistently across all JS files.
